      "statement": "DATA_DIR mounts as /data into Jellyfin, Sonarr, Radarr and server-init, each arr app keeps its own ./config/<service> mount, Jellyfin also mounts ./cache/jellyfin, and DATA_DIR uses the Compose failed-if-unset form.",
